{
  "_comment": [
    "The game in stages. Design owns this file.",
    "A stage is a handful of things to do; finishing them all moves you on.",
    "They are still nudges rather than gates: nothing is locked behind them,",
    "because deciding what to do is the point of the world. What a stage buys",
    "you is knowing what this part of the game is about.",
    "kinds:",
    "  collect  what=item id        gather that many",
